    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Sobre os dados do Valkey",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Derived from traces by Tempo's span metrics: only sampled commands that ran inside a request/root span (`requireParentSpan`) are counted. Tempo's default span-metrics dimensions don't include `db.system.name`, so Valkey commands are told apart by span name: ioredis names spans after the lowercase command (`get`, `mget`, `evalsha`), while Postgres (`SELECT bookings`) and HTTP client spans (`POST`) are uppercase."
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      }
    },
